  "description": "A FAN FAVORITE - Revamped!\nExperience all the premium features of our Rebel 2.0 SS, now with a hassle-free Single Speed Gear System! Say goodbye to clunky shifting and broken derailleurs. If you're looking for a mid-drive bike that delivers whisper-quiet performance with mind-blowing power, the Rambo Rebel 2.0 SS is your perfect match.\nPowered by the Bafang BBSHD mid-drive motor, it’s Bafang’s quietest high-torque motor—noticeably quieter than the Bafang Ultra Drive—ensuring a smooth, silent ride without sacrificing power.\nFor the ultimate custom bike, finish it off by choosing your ideal rear sprocket:\n\nThe 40T rear sprocket for off-road adventures, hill climbing, and heavier loads\n\nThe 30T rear sprocket for a balanced mix of torque and speed, making it ideal for varied terrain, everyday riding, and general-purpose use.\nThe 22T rear sprocket for speed, efficient cruising, and flat terrain\n\nThe choice is yours, and we’re here to provide the best solution for your ride!",
